    "c1": {
      "anchor": "2-where#table-1",
      "kind": "table",
      "label": "2. Saying where",
      "excerpt": "The line What it is Writes? a web server at a REST server yes, with versions a g",
      "text": "let's add excel as well",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-05T13:02:02.416Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "a CSV or a Google Sheet",
      "offset": 310,
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:31:58.367Z",
          "html": "<p>Today <code>a spreadsheet at</code> reads only a CSV:  no Excel reader, and it'd take a new dependency.  Which words: <a href=\"/epics/data/data.plan.html#q31\">Q31</a> (recommended:  <code>a spreadsheet at \"recipes.xlsx\"</code>, by the ending).</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-05T13:21:34.019Z"
      }
    },
    "c2": {
      "anchor": "2-where#table-1",
      "kind": "table",
      "label": "2. Saying where",
      "excerpt": "The line What it is Writes? a web server at a REST server yes, with versions a g",
      "text": "Is airtable working?",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-05T13:02:16.577Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "Airtable",
      "offset": 397,
      "edited": "2026-11-05T13:02:18.796Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:29:19.354Z",
          "html": "<p><b>Partly.</b> It reads, saves and heals against a stand-in Airtable (its key on the server side, 4 requests a second under Airtable's 5, last save wins), and all its tests pass: 717 in the places tests, 49 in the recipe demo's, Airtable among them. Not yet: a real base (manual test M2 is still open), and <code>spell place ingest</code> can't look at one.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-05T13:21:35.136Z"
      }
    },
    "c3": {
      "anchor": "2-where#table-1",
      "kind": "table",
      "label": "2. Saying where",
      "excerpt": "The line What it is Writes? a web server at a REST server yes, with versions a g",
      "text": "also:  `an atmosphere spaces account`?",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-05T13:02:48.093Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "an atmosphere account at",
