          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:31:59.457Z",
          "html": "<p>Spaces have code (epic <code>atmosphere</code>'s trial) but no words yet.  Which words: <a href=\"/epics/data/data.plan.html#q32\">Q32</a> (recommended:  <code>an atmosphere space at</code>, since a space is a group's, not an account).</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
