      }
    },
    "c4": {
      "anchor": "2-where#table-1",
      "kind": "table",
      "label": "2. Saying where",
      "excerpt": "The line What it is Writes? a web server at a REST server yes, with versions a g",
      "text": "`stored in this device [for each tab]`\n= localStorage\n`for each tab` = sessionStorage",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-05T13:03:57.245Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "a database on this device",
      "offset": 520,
      "edited": "2026-11-05T13:04:38.836Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:32:00.545Z",
          "html": "<p>Today <code>a database on this device</code> is the browser's lasting storage (localStorage);  nothing keeps things per tab.  Your words, with the per-tab one: <a href=\"/epics/data/data.plan.html#q33\">Q33</a>.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-05T13:21:37.238Z"
      }
    },
    "c5": {
      "anchor": "2-where#table-2",
      "kind": "table",
      "label": "2. Saying where",
      "excerpt": "The line For a server that ... its key is the secret \"GITHUB_TOKEN\", if it's set",
      "text": "`its optional key is`",
