          "html": "<p>J5 chose a folder of util, for fewer exports, TypeScript settings and test projects.  The census (about 200 import lines in 113 files, one exports entry, two test projects, no lint change) and the choice: <a href=\"/epics/data/data.plan.html#q38\">Q38</a> (recommended:  <code>spell/places</code>, the server half staying in server).</p>"
